WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:08.527
Mr Saeed: Hello! Welcome to English Path. Unit one, lesson five. Numbers, names and plurals.

2
00:00:11.827 --> 00:00:15.492
Mr Saeed: Good morning! Let's look at your ID cards.

3
00:00:15.492 --> 00:00:18.279
Mr Saeed: Fahad, what's your first name?

4
00:00:18.279 --> 00:00:20.878
Fahad: My first name is Fahad.

5
00:00:20.878 --> 00:00:23.024
Mr Saeed: And your surname?

6
00:00:23.024 --> 00:00:25.770
Fahad: My surname is Alharbi.

7
00:00:25.770 --> 00:00:28.244
Mr Saeed: Sara, what's your number?

8
00:00:28.244 --> 00:00:32.859
Sara: My number is 7 2 5 1.

9
00:00:32.859 --> 00:00:35.004
Mr Saeed: Very good! Thank you.

10
00:00:38.304 --> 00:00:42.382
Mr Saeed: Now let's count. Ali, how many books?

11
00:00:42.382 --> 00:00:46.994
Ali: 1, 2, 3, 4, 5. Five books.

12
00:00:46.994 --> 00:00:49.846
Mr Saeed: Sara, how many pens?

13
00:00:49.846 --> 00:00:54.705
Sara: 1, 2, 3. Three pens.

14
00:00:54.705 --> 00:00:57.264
Mr Saeed: And how many boxes?

15
00:00:57.264 --> 00:00:59.562
Ali: Ten boxes!

16
00:00:59.562 --> 00:01:02.246
Mr Saeed: Very good! Ten boxes.

17
00:01:05.346 --> 00:01:08.067
Mr Saeed: Let's learn some new words.

18
00:01:08.067 --> 00:01:09.765
Mr Saeed: Id card.

19
00:01:09.765 --> 00:01:11.557
Mr Saeed: First name.

20
00:01:11.557 --> 00:01:13.202
Mr Saeed: Surname.

21
00:01:13.202 --> 00:01:14.758
Mr Saeed: Number.

22
00:01:14.758 --> 00:01:16.201
Mr Saeed: Letter.

23
00:01:16.201 --> 00:01:18.137
Mr Saeed: Capital letter.

24
00:01:18.137 --> 00:01:19.702
Mr Saeed: Question.

25
00:01:19.702 --> 00:01:21.281
Mr Saeed: Answer.

26
00:01:21.281 --> 00:01:23.923
Mr Saeed: Plural. More than one.

27
00:01:26.323 --> 00:01:29.021
Mr Saeed: Now, numbers.

28
00:01:29.021 --> 00:01:32.077
Mr Saeed: One. Two. Three.

29
00:01:32.077 --> 00:01:35.452
Mr Saeed: Four. Five. Six.

30
00:01:35.452 --> 00:01:38.801
Mr Saeed: Seven. Eight. Nine.

31
00:01:38.801 --> 00:01:41.049
Mr Saeed: Ten. And zero.

32
00:01:43.849 --> 00:01:49.540
Mr Saeed: One book. Two books. For most nouns, we add s.

33
00:01:49.540 --> 00:01:52.290
Mr Saeed: Book. Books.

34
00:01:52.290 --> 00:01:55.090
Mr Saeed: Car. Cars.

35
00:01:55.090 --> 00:01:57.759
Mr Saeed: Bag. Bags.

36
00:01:57.759 --> 00:02:01.508
Mr Saeed: most nouns + s = معظم الأسماء + s

37
00:02:04.308 --> 00:02:10.200
Mr Saeed: After s, sh, ch or x, we add e s.

38
00:02:10.200 --> 00:02:13.167
Mr Saeed: Bus. Buses.

39
00:02:13.167 --> 00:02:16.002
Mr Saeed: Box. Boxes.

40
00:02:16.002 --> 00:02:18.590
Mr Saeed: Sandwich. Sandwiches.

41
00:02:21.390 --> 00:02:25.832
Mr Saeed: After a number from two to ten, use the plural.

42
00:02:25.832 --> 00:02:28.042
Mr Saeed: Three cups.

43
00:02:28.042 --> 00:02:30.295
Mr Saeed: Five houses.

44
00:02:30.295 --> 00:02:32.060
Mr Saeed: Ten photographs.

45
00:02:34.860 --> 00:02:37.577
Mr Saeed: Now, opposites.

46
00:02:37.577 --> 00:02:40.161
Mr Saeed: First. Last.

47
00:02:40.161 --> 00:02:42.827
Mr Saeed: Question. Answer.

48
00:02:42.827 --> 00:02:46.706
Mr Saeed: Singular. Plural. One, or more than one.

49
00:02:49.506 --> 00:02:52.335
Mr Saeed: Now listen and repeat.

50
00:02:52.335 --> 00:02:55.936
Mr Saeed: One, two, three!

51
00:02:57.836 --> 00:03:01.691
Mr Saeed: Four, five, six!

52
00:03:03.591 --> 00:03:06.612
Mr Saeed: What's your first name?

53
00:03:08.512 --> 00:03:11.450
Mr Saeed: What's your surname?

54
00:03:13.350 --> 00:03:15.741
Mr Saeed: Ten photographs, please.

55
00:03:20.841 --> 00:03:24.750
Mr Saeed: Quick quiz! Choose the right word.

56
00:03:24.750 --> 00:03:31.045
Mr Saeed: One bag. Two, blank. Bags, or bag?

57
00:03:33.345 --> 00:03:35.514
Fahad: Two bags.

58
00:03:35.514 --> 00:03:41.680
Mr Saeed: One bus. Four, blank. Buses, or buss?

59
00:03:43.980 --> 00:03:46.046
Sara: Four buses.

60
00:03:46.046 --> 00:03:53.275
Mr Saeed: One sandwich. Two, blank. Sandwiches, or sandwichs?

61
00:03:55.575 --> 00:03:57.035
Ali: Two sandwiches.

62
00:03:59.435 --> 00:04:04.478
Mr Saeed: Now it's your turn. Say your first name and your surname.

63
00:04:10.378 --> 00:04:13.867
Mr Saeed: Well done! See you in Unit two.
